    <guid isPermaLink="false">6adc2149c96c8942ec116533</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>西子分享了自己实地游览过的日本关东地区秋季赏秋景点，按红叶变色时间排序推荐了5处地点：上高地、日光、河口湖、箱根、镰仓。</span></p><p><span>（照片请拉到最下面，图多杀猫）</span></p><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>西子、卓富贵</span></p><p><span>【如何找到我们】</span></p><p><span>听友群+vx：fuguizhuo77</span></p><p><span>商务合作+vx：linkandmipha</span></p><p><span>官方微博：@卖鱼桥分桥</span></p><p><span>【shownotes】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">00:02:31</a> 上高地景点介绍与行程建议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">00:04:41</a> 上高地观赏体验与交通提示</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="481">00:08:01</a> 日光景点基础信息介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">00:13:32</a> 日光核心景观与游览提示</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">00:16:03</a> 日光改造使馆景点介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1264">00:21:04</a> 日光实用出行提示</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">00:28:22</a> 河口湖基础信息与最佳时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2086">00:34:46</a> 河口湖常见言论辟谣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2538">00:42:18</a> 箱根景点特色与游览建议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3013">00:50:13</a> 箱根费用与景点体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3138">00:52:18</a> 镰仓赏秋推荐与特色</span></p><p><span>【songlist】</span></p><p><span>つじあやの - 月が泣いてる</span></p><p><span>【为卖鱼桥发电】</span></p><p><span>1、</span><a href="https://afdian.net/@maiyuqiao" data-url="https://afdian.net/@maiyuqiao"><u><span>爱发电平台</span></u></a><span>为我们发电，更多精彩的节目花絮，背后的故事，还有录制提纲都可以在发电后解锁哦～</span></p><p><span>2、公众号”西子今天吃什么“进行打赏</span></p><p><span>3、网易云平台节目播放页面进行打赏</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>上高地：</span></strong></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/likNGvDRfFRjn4S8qmrJ1Xg-_QeF.jpg"><p><span>▲ 11月 2 日到的时候还是晴天，还是正常的秋色</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls0CQjcFACzzUvJnYMyVS0ezSZvV.jpg"><p><span>▲ 第二天一早外面已经雪白一片，住宿的旅馆大厅</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsB1Xy6h12TwJHr7CpFCpA5zdBLw.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loMVrTT2jZO_4rdAICMynO3C1IVd.jpg"><p><span>▲雪与秋</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltJT4q3JyCysqtpl2gIu0k4BBpmO.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltWhO7o3-HrQa5kCYwr72e8f5_VK.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgI2JZYHuBb8A8vAOmU66V9Dh27H.jpg"><p><span>▲下午就晴天了，能看到山顶还覆盖着白雪</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhodEtwthctz66cfiO3eHgPm4lLc.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsXcnGOJT5xjYct_boM4Y_VIdmLz.jpg"><p><span>▲河童桥附近，也是上高地的巴士站所在地，所以最热闹，吃饭住宿特产的店铺也集中在这一块</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>日光</span></strong></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhZYLGgoWJsK3KqXJbPmZU5jQ4lr.jpg"><p><span>▲日光东照寺的唐门</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljzrkgrW83rY09ZMowBKK_UVtwCX.jpg"><p><span>▲山路十八弯</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpmEhIhOI7QRoDwveyEemtbvnbgu.jpg"><p><span>▲到的时候叶子已经快掉光了，如果再早一周是最好的，但是当时在上高地，今年由于观景台维修又去不了，只能等明年了。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lt-74ztOuaEb7nHkFXyNUOnz9CSV.jpg"><p><span>▲中禅寺湖，有点像海，其实是湖</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj0xRXuAXmTv72IRewzvXQBPkcey.jpg"><p><span>▲法国的大使馆，但是不能参观，连院子里都不能进</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lphh2LJyDXcjXSGgR8pK8hJ7kLCv.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhCNdzPYyrqksBq7YuimS305Bl3K.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmgo0hl3Xo74mFiXYLTX-IppYFQM.jpg"><p><span>▲梦中情房，意大利大使馆</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls_X_XrlvehjppBPb6gvYwez2UTH.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgZ9oWoWx81U62KjWUpaD-wLFu2f.jpg"><p><span>▲英国大使馆</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrwMKBuvuWPldfLogP1DHauRHwoK.jpg"><ul><li><p><strong><span>河口湖</span></strong></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnCvJ7GPzlxh6JL5AMAduZJYC2wh.jpg"><p><span>▲白天的枫叶回廊</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhUggSPV4oIK51DkwgxPjV3OfZH6.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpWKg4bynWGolWHnb84P7LCYrPjw.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhYTR_5wnA2WWHJsocpq7zvj3h1p.jpg"><p><span>▲富士山和红叶</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpo74xwhfoDFyIs3fUTUTJMylfPw.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loQ2A2tKwidE_IZh2c5dYhb20L6y.jpg"><p><span>▲在河口湖骑行</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loTHz4WHtp8-xcOA_P895T8quHON.jpg"><p><span>▲晚上点灯后的枫叶回廊</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lg4M3pyUw-_aw6_wgrZAxmabJ2_z.jpg"><p><span>▲晨雾下的河口湖</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln0YDM3wzOtMfOEGzudWv-2GV1PN.jpg"><p><span>▲去山中湖的路上的富士山</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgTACb_fCmEkqP4ERUkeWpIkWEdZ.jpg"><p><span>▲山中湖的天鹅和富士山</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpB_4g-CDsOBAJgaM0c3Ig2pwPRw.jpg"><p><span>▲山中湖沿湖有骑行道，骑行体验比河口湖好一点</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>箱根</span></strong></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loUAfJ2zZBbJRTw1Z5NbSwseMv7Z.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljMmjMIgSbCKsHKrnJRhuHgxgwxP.jpg"><p><span>▲穿和服的女人（不是我）和红叶</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lllBJXCVxcVIK3WeWNl3LlKa7g7i.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lt0OcY3e-_tsjYCyqqY_vW1qsSJz.jpg"><p><span>▲登山电车</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhkk_jMBArL8jZvx7r3m4pZ82gTV.jpg"><p><span>▲餐厅的风景</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltxnPCEKnaeGurgyPjZBuD_0rMFQ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnKB8ZgPY00c0a68eOJoD-6lmeb5.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls4M1BvCkr0peODqolHHzJbLJNDl.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmQJXc11xDdAaYmh-j7dhxkXjSyE.jpg"><p><span>▲成川美术馆视角下的芦之湖和富士山</span></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>镰仓</span></strong></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsgHSSLeofq5C6uNUdM6oz4diwAn.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lniFID_O9RBsXZYZ7QXq53vA6PCX.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmulgXdlFlnbPWtcLp5q-oDMjrNq.jpg"><p><span>▲是不是有点京都寺庙的感觉</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrnjPmZwtlGxa8RGdBtMVHWAluTB.jpg"><p><span>▲鹤岗八幡宫，偶遇了婚礼，这是巫女和安保在疏散人群</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk_vpaLyiZrLrpb_xFhI4oLhxjsl.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvpGQCW8y4VTzhaqbNHbKJpWw3Sr.jpg"><p><span>▲镰仓七里滨的海边落日</span></p>]]></description>
