  <item>
    <title>129.独自去西藏，才没有易如反掌呢！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681b757adb57cd35f70c5645</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681b757adb57cd35f70c5645</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次西子独自一个人来到了西藏，正值春天林芝桃花季。去西藏的路并不容易，这之间的辛酸苦辣个中滋味只有自己才知道，风景美则美矣，可似乎我们无法悠闲的欣赏它，美丽的背后必然是同时存在身体的难受。这一路，有很多不开心，也有很多开心，也许，我们都应该更早出发。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>西子、卓富贵</span></p><span></span><p><span>【如何找到我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群+vx：fuguizhuo77</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作+vx：linkandmipha</span></p><span></span><p><span>官方微博：@卖鱼桥分桥</span></p><span></span><p><span>【shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 为什么去西藏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a> 关于旅途的顾虑，谁说找搭子易如反掌？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> 到达拉萨，和青旅的人一起吃饭，逛八廓街</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 布达拉宫，一爬一个不吱声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1859">30:59</a> 羊湖，非常规路线，美但痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> 自治区博物馆和色拉寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2574">42:54</a> 幸运的找到了林芝的搭子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2855">47:35</a> 巴松措，三大圣湖中最平庸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3158">52:38</a> 新错，快跑，别去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">56:50</a> 鲁朗一日游，行程很好，但体验很差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a>激情开麦，拉萨旅游体验太差！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3917">65:17</a> 国内旅游城市的通病，如何才能不被打扰？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4259">70:59</a> 总而言之，西藏还是值得去</span></p><span></span><p><span>【songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>许巍 - 蓝莲花</span></p><span></span><p><span>李晨阳 - 长满马兰花的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span>【为卖鱼桥发电】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、</span><a href="https://afdian.net/@maiyuqiao" data-url="https://afdian.net/@maiyuqiao"><span>爱发电平台</span></a><span>为我们发电，更多精彩的节目花絮，背后的故事，还有录制提纲都可以在发电后解锁哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、公众号”西子今天吃什么“进行打赏</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、网易云平台节目播放页面进行打赏</span></p>]]></description>
