  <item>
    <title>126.日本关西追枫一人游</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6752e440d0ef2dcaf99bc5a6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6752e440d0ef2dcaf99bc5a6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>某天西子突然迸发了去日本看枫叶的想法，在还没申请签证的情况下，迅速的订好了酒店。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次的行程计划一共9天，包含和歌山大阪京都。</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有安排去下面的奈良或神户，更别说东京了，因为独自出行自由度更高，所以打算随性一点，不制定过多计划。</span></p><span></span><p><span>而恰恰是没有计划没有期待的旅程，最终收获了很多意想不到的惊喜。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在为期9天的旅途中，偶遇了太平洋旁的温泉，偶遇了友好善良的本地人，偶遇了烟花大会，偶遇了大自然的染色盘一般的红叶。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>西子、卓富贵</span></p><span></span><p><span>【如何找到我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群+vx：fuguizhuo77</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作+vx：linkandmipha</span></p><span></span><p><span>官方微博：@卖鱼桥分桥</span></p><span></span><p><span>【shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 总开销以及各项花费明细</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 9天行程概述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a> 出发前的准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a> 准备了但是没有用上的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> 关于日本的交通以及如何准确快捷的坐车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2433">40:33</a> 和歌山的旅途意犹未尽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3064">51:04</a> 和歌山遇到的超友好的本地人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3650">60:50</a> 中日点餐文化差异：量词的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4133">68:53</a> 在大阪理发的体验：大可不必</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4310">71:50</a> 大阪城公园：无聊的景点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4745">79:05</a> 烟火大会很浪漫，不要钱显得更值了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5966">99:26</a> 京都大德寺：黄梅院/兴临院/龙源院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6114">101:54</a> 北边的其它景点：光悦寺/圆成寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6375">106:15</a> 建仁寺和蓝瓶子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6701">111:41</a> 清水寺：全地球的人都来清水寺了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6898">114:58</a>市区的景点好无聊，诈骗景点这是可以说的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7274">121:14</a> 高雄三寺，只去了两个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7469">124:29</a> 叡山电铁：日本人真的好会！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7630">127:10</a> 岚山祐斋亭才不是诈骗景点</span></p><span></span><p><span>【songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>深度睡眠乐队 - 我发现了一颗新的恒星</span></p><span></span><p><span>Seto - 夏天 烟火 我的尸体</span></p><span></span><p><span>【为卖鱼桥发电】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、</span><a href="https://afdian.net/@maiyuqiao" data-url="https://afdian.net/@maiyuqiao"><span>爱发电平台</span></a><span>为我们发电，更多精彩的节目花絮，背后的故事，还有录制提纲都可以在发电后解锁哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、公众号”西子今天吃什么“进行打赏</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、网易云平台节目播放页面进行打赏</span></p>]]></description>
