    <title>125.穿过伊昭公路来到夏塔，满心期待却遇上坏天气</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671a5451b7c57bc077bc14e1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671a5451b7c57bc077bc14e1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>离开薰衣草小镇，我们途径伊昭公路来到昭苏县夏特乡夏塔景区。</span></p><span></span><p><span>伊昭公路人称小独库，一路风光迤逦，游客稀少，如果不想走全程独库的朋友，很值得来体验一下。</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏塔，是我们本次旅途的重点之战，却因天气一波三折，最终也未能完美如愿，只能带着遗憾离开。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>西子、卓富贵</span></p><span></span><p><span>【如何找到我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群+vx：fuguizhuo77</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作+vx：linkandmipha</span></p><span></span><p><span>官方微博：@卖鱼桥分桥</span></p><span></span><p><span>【shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 独库我都去了我还去什么小独库啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a> 令人疑惑的标语：停车场带写着：禁止停车，禁止拍照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a> 伊昭是很惬意的旅途，和景区完全不一样的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a> 野狼谷景区，修这么好都不收个5块10块的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a> 为了看雪山所以选择去夏塔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 没被闹钟吵醒先被暴雨吵醒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a> 去景区前一天遇上桥断了是什么什么运气？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> 西子暴言：夏塔好无聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3008">50:08</a> 如果要去夏塔，给大家的小建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>【songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>深度睡眠乐队 - 我发现了一颗新的恒星</span></p><span></span><p><span>Seto - 夏天 烟火 我的尸体</span></p><span></span><p><span>【为卖鱼桥发电】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、</span><a href="https://afdian.net/@maiyuqiao" data-url="https://afdian.net/@maiyuqiao"><span>爱发电平台</span></a><span>为我们发电，更多精彩的节目花絮，背后的故事，还有录制提纲都可以在发电后解锁哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、公众号”西子今天吃什么“进行打赏</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、网易云平台节目播放页面进行打赏</span></p>]]></description>
