  <item>
    <title>122.新疆行之准备了一个月</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668a1f63ae8e21859a0e1cdb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668a1f63ae8e21859a0e1cdb</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上个月我们又去了一趟新疆，这趟旅途从五一假期开始规划，中间几经波折，最后终于敲定，本期节目，我们将和大家分享这趟旅途在前期准备过程中发生的一些事情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>西子、卓富贵</span></p><span></span><p><span>【如何找到我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群+vx：fuguizhuo77</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作+vx：linkandmipha</span></p><span></span><p><span>官方微博：@卖鱼桥分桥</span></p><span></span><p><span>【shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 为什么又要去新疆？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> 计划为何反复修改？卓老师直言有种做乙方的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="869">14:29</a> 三个买机票的方案，对应三版行程，应该如何选择？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 定好的计划为何又被修改？变量真是太多了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1857">30:57</a> 租车走大运，低价租好车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2586">43:06</a> 住宿消费降级后是否还能住到又好又干净的房间？住宿好坏和价格正相关吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3156">52:36</a> 无用的东西分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3662">61:02</a> 有用的东西分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>【songlist】</span></p><span></span><p><span>安图声乐队 - 逆流时光</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tony Ann - ICARUS</span></p><span></span><p><span>【为卖鱼桥发电】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、</span><a href="https://afdian.net/@maiyuqiao" data-url="https://afdian.net/@maiyuqiao"><span>爱发电平台</span></a><span>为我们发电，更多精彩的节目花絮，背后的故事，还有录制提纲都可以在发电后解锁哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、公众号”西子今天吃什么“进行打赏</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、网易云平台节目播放页面进行打赏</span></p>]]></description>
